      "factor": "Risk Management",
      "polarity": 1,
      "reason_headline": "Prudent Risk Assessment",
      "reason_detailed": "The agent assessed the risk of the trade as 'Medium' and made decisions based on this assessment, demonstrating prudent risk management practices."
